ÏIntegrated Development Environment, starting theÏ To start the Integrated Development Environment, double-click on the IDE icon.  This opens the Open Watcom IDE Project window.
¥
˜3˜Quitting_the_Open_Watcom_Integrated_Development_Environment˜Quitting the Open Watcom Integrated Development Environment˜Open Watcom Integrated Development Environment
